    },
    {
      "number": 1621,
      "text": "They both rushed to the door and she tore his shirt from behind, and they found her husband at the door. She said, “What is the punishment for someone who tried to dishonor your wife, except to be imprisoned or a painful punishment?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
